  note         = {safety by format: an external audit found no code-execution path},
  note-zh      = {以格式保安全：外部审计未发现代码执行路径},
  tldr    = {The safetensors format and its commissioned external audit, which found no arbitrary-code-execution path: a load is a bounds-checked parse and a memory-map, with no reconstruction hook.},
